  "notes": "{議論|ぎろん} refers to formal or serious discussions and debates.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {議論|ぎろん}する (to discuss, to debate)\n- {議論|ぎろん}を{呼|よ}ぶ (to spark debate)\n- {議論|ぎろん}が{分|わ}かれる (opinions are divided)\n- {議論|ぎろん}の{余地|よち}がない (no room for argument)\n\nCOMPOUND WORDS:\n- {議論|ぎろん}{好|ず}き (argumentative person)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {議論|ぎろん}: discussion, debate (formal)\n- {話|はな}し{合|あ}い: discussion (general)\n- {討論|とうろん}: debate (formal, structured)\n- {口論|こうろん}: quarrel, verbal fight",
